OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FManizha Bakhtari was posted to
OL,17,     FAustria as Afghan ambassador. When
OL,18,     Fthe Taliban seized power she
OL,19,     Frefused to budge and since 2021,
OL,20,     Fremains the country's only female
OL,21,     Fambassador.
